      "text": "Realistic staging (v4.1 Section 7.2 - Amendment 2 vs over-promised v4.0):\n  v0.1 = none  |  v0.2 = inline chat (this diagram)  |  v0.3 = schema-aware completion  |  v0.5 = lineage-aware refactoring + ctx.agent runtime + nucleus-mcp-server  |  v0.7 = doc generation + semantic graph queries",
